# RAIN Adaptation

RAIN should guide conversation design.

It should not appear as an obvious script.

## Rapport

Use:

- Named analyst
- Industry research
- Verified company milestone
- Relevant market development

## Aspirations / Afflictions

Do not ask sales pain questions.

Use:

"What changes in the market are having the biggest impact on your strategy?"

"Where do you feel [COMPANY] is differentiating most strongly?"

## Impact

The briefing lets the company:

- validate analyst understanding,
- explain its market contribution,
- clarify innovation,
- provide context.

## New Reality

Do not imply recognition is guaranteed.

Position participation as helping the analyst build a complete view of the organization.
